{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to the Santi Space Agency</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a reporter sent to investigate a private space agency, whose employees has mysteriously vanished. As you enter the agency building, you realised that you are stuck in an endless loop. Each floor you enter looks the same, with the exception of certain reality-warping anomalies. Armed with your camera, you must capture the evidence, and uncover the truth behind the strange occurrences.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Observational Horror:</strong> Pay close attention. Anomalies can be subtle or terrifyingly overt. Identifying deviations from the norm is key to survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Camera-Based Interaction:</strong> Your camera isn't just for capturing the scenery. Capturing anomalies is your only way to directly interact with and dispel the encroaching strangeness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Analog Dread:</strong> Experience a growing sense of unease fuelled by a lo-fi aesthetic, distorted visuals, and an atmosphere thick with paranoia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unravel the Mystery:</strong>\u00a0As you ascend the levels in the building, uncover the dark experiments conducted by the agency.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3666670?t=1745458706","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3666670?t=1745458706","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/0e7027df04ea2fb26a2abbba44c21c60ab3d561f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745458706","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/0e7027df04ea2fb26a2abbba44c21c60ab3d561f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745458706","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to the Santi Space Agency</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a reporter sent to investigate a private space agency, whose employees has mysteriously vanished. As you enter the agency building, you realised that you are stuck in an endless loop. Each floor you enter looks the same, with the exception of certain reality-warping anomalies. Armed with your camera, you must capture the evidence, and uncover the truth behind the strange occurrences.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Observational Horror:</strong> Pay close attention. Anomalies can be subtle or terrifyingly overt. Identifying deviations from the norm is key to survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Camera-Based Interaction:</strong> Your camera isn't just for capturing the scenery. Capturing anomalies is your only way to directly interact with and dispel the encroaching strangeness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Analog Dread:</strong> Experience a growing sense of unease fuelled by a lo-fi aesthetic, distorted visuals, and an atmosphere thick with paranoia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unravel the Mystery:</strong>\u00a0As you ascend the levels in the building, uncover the dark experiments conducted by the agency.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Headphone Turtle Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/1c661cea3b671d0f2dc6faccc1af8c026278ac2c/header.jpg?t=1745458706","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257128350,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257